'''qn. a thief is robbing a store and carry a maximal weight of W into his knapsack. There are N items and ith item weighs wi and value is vi.  
Considering the constraints of the maximum weight a knapsack can carry, you have to find and return the max value a thief can generate by stealing items '''
https://chatgpt.com/s/t_6a821654b9bc819192359198ee35ffe0

def knap(W,w,v):
  n=len(w)
  dp=[0]*(W+1)
  for i in range(n):
    for weight in range(W,w-1,-1):
      dp[weight]=max(dp[weight],dp[weight-w[i]]+v[i])
 return dp[W]
